{
    "title": "Princesses - Enchanted Castle",
    "description": "Have you ever dreamt of visiting an enchanting place full of wonders? Explore the castle where every magic princess doll would love to live! Here, you can dress up, care for, and play with your favorite magic princess doll!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udff0 <b>LIVE IN THE CASTLE</b>\r\nGrab your special wand and watch as a unique glass dome opens to reveal the most precious princess doll waiting for you! Delight every magic princess with tasty treats, entertain every doll with playful games, and explore exciting activities in this magnificent doll fantasy world.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc78<b> MEET EVERY MAGIC PRINCESS</b>\r\nEvery sweet princess doll wants to live in your fabulous castle! Meet all of them, from the charming Ice and Butterfly princesses to the fantastic princess doll Cleopatra. Each magic princess has her unique qualities, making her truly a one-of-a-kind princess doll. Pick your favorite!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf89\u200b <b>DISCOVER FUN ACTIVITIES</b>\r\nBoredom doesn't exist in this marvelous doll life! Uncover the wonders of colorful mystery boxes and enjoy delightful activities with every lovely magic princess doll! Play the harp, relax on a fluffy cloud bed, admire a beautiful fountain, or hop onto a flying carpet\u2014lots of fun activities await your magic princess doll in this game!\r\n\r\n\u2b50 <b>PLAY MINI-GAMES</b>\r\nEvery magic princess doll adores mini-games, so join in and play with them! Jump to collect golden coins, get creative in a drawing game, or explore cosmic space. Want to try even more mini-games? Match one magic princess to another, and enjoy!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc84 <b>VISIT MAKEUP SALON</b>\r\nYour magic princess loves to shine, so get ready to show off your creativity! Make your lovely doll sparkle with vibrant eyeshadows, glittery blush, or colorful face paint. Made a little oopsie? Don't worry, just grab a cleaning wipe and fix it up. Let's make every single magic princess shine!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc57\u200b <b>DRESS UP YOUR MAGIC PRINCESS</b>\r\nDiscover a vast collection of adorable outfits, accessories, and shoes! Turn every magic princess into the most stylish princess doll. You\u2019ll have an even wider collection of items with every unlocked princess doll. So, don't keep your charming princesses waiting \u2013 step into this doll fantasy game today!\r\n\r\nUPGRADE TO TUTOCLUB!\r\nSubscribe to enjoy a huge portfolio of games with extraordinary TutoClub features:\r\n- UNLIMITED GAME CONTENT: Exclusive access to complete games.\r\n- NO ADS: Smooth playtime experience with no interruptions.\r\n- SAFE SPACE ONLINE: A 100% family-friendly place with no unwelcome content.\r\n- PREMIUM IN-APP PURCHASES UNLOCKED: TutoClub members enjoy exclusive content.\r\n- FUN FOR ALL AGES\r\n- LEARNING THROUGH PLAY: Carefully curated selection of games that cherish creativity, self-expression, responsibility, attention to detail & problem solving skills.\r\nBecome a TutoClub member today & ensure enriching playtime experiences for your kids! Find out more: https://tutotoons.com/tutoclub/\r\n\r\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\r\n\r\nAbout TutoTOONS Game for Kids\r\nCrafted and play-tested with kids and toddlers, TutoTOONS games foster kids\u2019 creativity and help them learn while playing each game they love. Fun and educational TutoTOONS games strive to bring meaningful and safe mobile experience to millions of children worldwide.\r\n\r\nImportant Message to Parents\r\nThis app is free to download and play, but there may be certain in-game items that can be purchased for real money. By downloading this app you agree to TutoTOONS Privacy Policy and Terms of Use.\r\n\r\nDiscover More Fun with TutoTOONS!\r\n\u00b7 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/@TutoTOONS\r\n\u00b7 Learn more about us: https://tutotoons.com\r\n\u00b7 Read our blog: https://blog.tutotoons.com\r\n\u00b7 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/tutotoons\r\n\u00b7 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/tutotoons/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Have you ever dreamt of visiting an enchanting place full of wonders? Explore the castle where every magic princess doll would love to live! Here, you can dress up, care for, and play with your favorite magic princess doll!<br><br>\ud83c\udff0 <b>LIVE IN THE CASTLE</b><br>Grab your special wand and watch as a unique glass dome opens to reveal the most precious princess doll waiting for you! Delight every magic princess with tasty treats, entertain every doll with playful games, and explore exciting activities in this magnificent doll fantasy world.<br><br>\ud83d\udc78<b> MEET EVERY MAGIC PRINCESS</b><br>Every sweet princess doll wants to live in your fabulous castle! Meet all of them, from the charming Ice and Butterfly princesses to the fantastic princess doll Cleopatra. Each magic princess has her unique qualities, making her truly a one-of-a-kind princess doll. Pick your favorite!<br><br>\ud83c\udf89\u200b <b>DISCOVER FUN ACTIVITIES</b><br>Boredom doesn&#39;t exist in this marvelous doll life! Uncover the wonders of colorful mystery boxes and enjoy delightful activities with every lovely magic princess doll! Play the harp, relax on a fluffy cloud bed, admire a beautiful fountain, or hop onto a flying carpet\u2014lots of fun activities await your magic princess doll in this game!<br><br>\u2b50 <b>PLAY MINI-GAMES</b><br>Every magic princess doll adores mini-games, so join in and play with them! Jump to collect golden coins, get creative in a drawing game, or explore cosmic space. Want to try even more mini-games? Match one magic princess to another, and enjoy!<br><br>\ud83d\udc84 <b>VISIT MAKEUP SALON</b><br>Your magic princess loves to shine, so get ready to show off your creativity! Make your lovely doll sparkle with vibrant eyeshadows, glittery blush, or colorful face paint. Made a little oopsie? Don&#39;t worry, just grab a cleaning wipe and fix it up. Let&#39;s make every single magic princess shine!<br><br>\ud83d\udc57\u200b <b>DRESS UP YOUR MAGIC PRINCESS</b><br>Discover a vast collection of adorable outfits, accessories, and shoes! Turn every magic princess into the most stylish princess doll. You\u2019ll have an even wider collection of items with every unlocked princess doll. So, don&#39;t keep your charming princesses waiting \u2013 step into this doll fantasy game today!<br><br>UPGRADE TO TUTOCLUB!<br>Subscribe to enjoy a huge portfolio of games with extraordinary TutoClub features:<br>- UNLIMITED GAME CONTENT: Exclusive access to complete games.<br>- NO ADS: Smooth playtime experience with no interruptions.<br>- SAFE SPACE ONLINE: A 100% family-friendly place with no unwelcome content.<br>- PREMIUM IN-APP PURCHASES UNLOCKED: TutoClub members enjoy exclusive content.<br>- FUN FOR ALL AGES<br>- LEARNING THROUGH PLAY: Carefully curated selection of games that cherish creativity, self-expression, responsibility, attention to detail &amp; problem solving skills.<br>Become a TutoClub member today &amp; ensure enriching playtime experiences for your kids! Find out more: https://tutotoons.com/tutoclub/<br><br>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -<br><br>About TutoTOONS Game for Kids<br>Crafted and play-tested with kids and toddlers, TutoTOONS games foster kids\u2019 creativity and help them learn while playing each game they love. Fun and educational TutoTOONS games strive to bring meaningful and safe mobile experience to millions of children worldwide.<br><br>Important Message to Parents<br>This app is free to download and play, but there may be certain in-game items that can be purchased for real money. By downloading this app you agree to TutoTOONS Privacy Policy and Terms of Use.<br><br>Discover More Fun with TutoTOONS!<br>\u00b7 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/@TutoTOONS<br>\u00b7 Learn more about us: https://tutotoons.com<br>\u00b7 Read our blog: https://blog.tutotoons.com<br>\u00b7 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/tutotoons<br>\u00b7 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/tutotoons/",
